    "why": "\"Relevant\" is always followed by \"to\" - relevant to the case, to the discussion, to the issue. \"Relevant for\" appears occasionally in loose usage but is not standard, and \"relevant with/about\" is simply wrong.",
    "topic": "prepositions",
    "flag": null,
